WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.360
Huh? Juju-sama?

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.990
What are you looking at?

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.120
Sasami sent me some picture postcards.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.370
They seem to be photos from her trip.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.250
Wow, they're—

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.500
having fun here...?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.880
Don't ask me.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.390
Th-This is...

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:36.770
the inn Sasami-san is staying at!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.270
Oh!

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.030
Paparin, you're here!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.920
I'm hungry.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:32.130
I <i>felt</i> like I'd eaten because our senses were linked,

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.630
but Tama's the one who ate.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.390
<i>I</i> haven't eaten a thing.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.760
Time to eat!

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:44.850
Oh yeah.

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.150
I'm on my own for the bath too.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.800
With this, I've become one with the
Dragon's Life Force flowing in this island

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:19.720
and finished tuning my body to be an appropriate vessel for the Nine-headed Dragon.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:23.310
Now I just need to collect energy to revive it and...

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:24.980
Taking a morning bath, Edogawa-san?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.270
You've already caught
wind of my plot, Sasami-san?!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.730
But it's too late!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.900
The ritual is primed to begin!

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.150
Huh? What? Shut up.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.030
What else could it be?

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.450
She's my enemy!

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.330
She can only be here to throw me off guard and interfere with my scheme!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:44.200
Edogawa-san, <i>that</i> isn't out right now, is it?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.080
That doesn't matter!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.960
I see. So it doesn't matter...

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.670
Hey.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.420
Tsurugi-chan joined the chat room.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.670
Morning, Tsurugi.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.840
Whoa!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:58.010
What are you doing in your birthday suit?!

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:01.300
Don't move on to the sex scene while I'm asleep!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.100
I can't get a complete set of CGs if you do!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.480
This isn't a game.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.140
And why are you there?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.770
What happened to Tama?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:09.350
Wait.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.230
Oh, right.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.860
Tama joined the chat room.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:16.690
It's okay.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.200
I already worked it out on my own.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.280
You can go back to sleep.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.070
Okay.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.120
Wake me up when it's time to eat.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.870
Tama left the chat room.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.000
Um, Edogawa-san...

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.010
Since we're both here, how about we wash each other's backs?

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:38.760
What?!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.010
What do I do?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.680
Sasami-san is actually Yagami Tama right now,

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.640
so if I carelessly engage her, I'll be devoured!

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.890
When you came in contact with her yesterday,

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.060
nothing happened, did it?

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.520
You're overthinking things, Ojou-sama.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:54.650
Then why would she suggest washing each other's backs?!

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:55.780
I don't know her true motive!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.950
Who are you guys, anyway?

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.360
Aren't you posting in the wrong channel?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.780
Who are you?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.160
Th-This is bad!

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:04.450
We got the rooms mixed up!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.160
Erase the logs and withdraw!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.410
Jo left the chat room.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.420
Kitsune-chan left the chat room.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.040
Babysitter left the chat room.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.510
Who were those guys?

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.550
I'm just gonna go back to sleep.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.180
Well...

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:23.680
Sh-Shit.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.810
Y-You said we should wash each other's backs, did you not?

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:31.390
Very well!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.650
Let's have a one-on-one showdown.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:36.230
I am also capable of eating someone,

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.940
so it's a level playing field.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.450
Let's wash each other's backs and see who'll end up eating who!

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:45.410
Um, it's nothing to get worked up about.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:51.830
Looks like Sasami's starting to get along with other people.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.670
Good girl.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.920
What is all this morning commotion?

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.380
Kagamin joined the chat room.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:01.300
All right, bring it on!

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:06.930
Okay, I'll clean every nook and cranny.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.810
She made the first move!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.190
Your skin's so clean and clear.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.070
Clearer than a celebrity's!

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:22.320
Who cares about outward appearances?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.200
What matters is your might,

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.070
the amount of power you can wield.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.620
I'm not strong, though.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.250
My hair's all curly and messy,

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.120
and my breasts are small.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.250
Edogawa-san, I...

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.880
envy you.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.300
You're acting quite humble.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.510
It's ticking me off.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:50.720
After voluntarily abandoning your birthright,

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:52.140
you're complaining about not having enough.

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:56.560
I don't quite get it, but I think you're right.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.070
I've gotta try harder before I start complaining.

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:02.110
You must've put in a lot of effort to get what you have.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.070
That's right.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:07.660
I survived a blood-soaked hell to overcome you people.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.870
That's our Edogawa-san!

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.700
That's amazing! I really admire you!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.450
You're quite lively for this early in the day.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:13.910
Oh!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.710
Morning, Kagami.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:16.370
You know,

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.790
I think I'm about to make a friend!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.300
Good for you.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.670
I've never had such an intimate conversation with another classmate before!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:24.800
I'm so happy!

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:26.180
Good for you.

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:29.430
Maybe I've gotten better at
communicating with others!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.810
Good for you.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.060
Thanks, Kagami.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.730
So she'll be your first friend.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:35.640
Oh, come on.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.060
You're my first, Kagami.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.310
I was just a stepping stone,

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.560
just there for practice.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:45.570
I'd hate to ruin your happy moment by saying something like that.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.570
Time for this third wheel to leave.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.330
Kagami?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:52.950
Kagami!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:53.950
Kagami?

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:58.330
What's wrong?

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.210
No, it's nothing.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.260
You're acting a bit too servile.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:11.600
Can't you act more confident and at least feign a positive attitude?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.520
Just watching you is annoying.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.940
You're my mortal enemy.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.150
I don't want to see you being so weak-spirited.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:26.900
Thanks. You're such a kind person, Edogawa-san.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.910
Wh-What was so kind about that?

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.950
I-I'm the greatest villain of the century!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.700
Um, if you don't mind,

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.790
can we exchange phone numbers later?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.290
Huh? For what?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.290
If you don't want to, that's okay.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.050
Or am I just being plain annoying?

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.050
I don't mind exchanging numbers.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.890
Thanks, Edogawa-san.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:00.560
I wanted to be friends with you.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:09.450
It does look like they were
having fun in these photos.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.610
Indeed.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:16.950
She should enjoy her youth while I'm holding on to the power of the supreme god.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:19.710
Oh?

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.260
There's not a bikini clad girl in sight,

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.890
but unlike the jam-packed beaches,

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.890
I can actually relax, which is awesome.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.390
I wish Tsukuyomi was here with me.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.150
There you are, Sasami-san!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:53.910
Challenging me to a battle when I'm at my most vulnerable, in nothing more than a swimsuit...

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.160
You aren't my mortal enemy for nothing!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.950
A battle?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.410
It's beach volleyball!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.290
You're trying to make me lower my guard,

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:01.920
hoping for a chance to eliminate me.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:02.540
However,

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.170
I, Edogawa Jou, have no blind spots!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.800
Oh, it's Kagami-nee!

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.300
I mean, Onee-sama!

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.180
Hey, can I ask her to join us?

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:17.390
Calling for help? You must have lost your nerve.

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:19.930
Fine by me. I'll defeat all of you together!

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:25.190
Hey, Kagami. Wanna play beach volleyball with us?

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:27.190
Please don't mind me.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.690
I'll probably just be a hindrance.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.070
No, you won't! I'm sure you'll have fun!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.910
I'd rather not.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:37.330
I want to concentrate on building this castle.

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.450
Okay. See you later, then.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.000
Here!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.760
The defense is still too weak.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.350
Exactly what sort of trip are they on?

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.980
Don't ask me.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.490
Ah, Sasami-san, I missed you!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:15.280
Now I'm here, so everything is all right!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:16.780
Be it eating,

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:17.780
taking a bath,

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.450
or other things you can't really be open about,

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.290
I'll take care of all of them!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:25.540
I am on your lap!

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:28.670
Up on Paparin's lap!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.300
Hey, Tama!

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:32.840
Don't call him Paparin. Call him Onii-chan.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.430
Plus, when I'm with him, I don't act like a baby

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.340
or hang on to him like that!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.010
You need to try to really act like me!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:42.060
Huh? You're always like this, Mamarin.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.810
Onii-chan, I love you!

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:50.940
Well, I won't ask too much from a child.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.190
You're finally awake, Tsukuyomi!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.200
Let's check out the shrine festival!

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:59.200
Treat me to a lot of takoyaki and cotton candy, Onii-chan!

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.830
There's a festival at the shrine?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.740
Yeah, it's an annual festival to the gods.

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:05.290
In this nation, gods reside in all things,

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.960
so eating and having fun counts as paying them respect.

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.960
We can get some grub there while we look around!

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.460
Of course, you're paying!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:13.550
Oh yeah.

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:17.130
It'd be nice to go to the festival with Edogawa-san.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.640
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.390
What is she scheming?

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.650
Calm down a little.

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:30.610
Edogawa-san!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:36.070
What did you call me out for?

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.780
The ritual is in its final stage.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:40.910
I see!

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:43.870
If you can introduce a flaw to the formula I've been working on,

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:44.950
the whole thing will collapse.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:50.330
You left me alone because you were waiting for the moment to ruin everything in a single blow!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.840
No less from my mortal enemy, Tsukuyomi Sasami!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:57.630
Let's see...

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:03.350
"I'm not really sure, but could it be that you're suffering from eighth-grader syndrome?"

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:04.720
Eighth grader?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:08.180
"We're in high school, and you're going on about mortal enemies like a kid!"

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.350
...is what she says.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:14.900
"I bet you'll start talking about your past lives, your abilities, and 'the organization' later."

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:22.070
Y-You already know all about our organization?!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.740
There actually <i>is</i> one?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.410
How much do you know about us?!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.790
Putting that aside, Edogawa-san...

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.910
Do you want to go to the shrine festival with me?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.670
Wait, Awashima-sama. What's going on here? Explain it to me!

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:35.300
You need to slow down.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:37.630
I'm not sensing any ill intention from Sasami-san.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:41.050
She's purely trying to befriend you.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.180
We're ready to go!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.560
Okay, I get it now.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.850
You want to get close to me, don't you?

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:50.810
Huh?

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.600
Oh, yep!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.310
I finally figured it out.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.320
Sorry.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:59.280
As someone who reigns above others, I had to be careful.

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:02.240
No problem! So, Edogawa-san, will you be my frie—

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.870
You want to be my servant, do you not?

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.120
What?!

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.370
You just threw this conversation in a shocking new direction.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.500
Well... Um...

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:14.330
I was overthinking things because you were my mortal enemy.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.630
You were buttering me up because you wanted to become my servant.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.630
Well... Er....

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:26.600
Do you think everyone is either your enemy or your servant?

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.810
What's the problem? It was a perfectly reasonable interpretation!

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:33.440
Sasami-san wants to be in a deeper,
more intimate relationship <i>as equals</i>.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:34.810
I see!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.310
I understand now!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.690
Everything has become clear.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:45.990
It was only when my body was in its more masculine form that you approached me, after all.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:46.700
Meaning,

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.700
you're in love with me!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.830
What?!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:53.080
Yet another shocking development!

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:56.170
Huh?

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.040
I now understand the situation completely.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.550
I'm not sure if I can reciprocate,

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:02.670
but it feels pretty good to be loved by someone.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.260
Calm down, Ojou-sama!

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.300
You're even more mistaken than before!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.350
Shut it!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.100
Well, you love me, right?

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.640
Y-Yeah!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.190
I love you, Edogawa-san!

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:17.520
That's why I wanna be your frie—

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.440
Don't call me "Edogawa-san"!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:22.530
If you truly love me, you should address me differently!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.410
Like "Jou-sama" or "Master." There are many options.

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:27.570
Huh?

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:31.410
"Then... can I call you 'Jou-chan'?" she says.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.410
Ridiculous.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.460
Kagami? Where are you going?

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.170
Let's walk around the festival together!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.930
If I'm around, you'll end up relying on me.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.140
Huh?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.800
You managed to find a friend on your own.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.430
Now, finish what you started and become real friends with her.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.890
Kagami...

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:58.060
I wish you a happy future, Sasami-san.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.070
Kagami?!

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:06.450
Kagami-nee!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.200
Hey, what's wrong?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.580
Like, Kagami-nee has...

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:14.750
Kagami-nee!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.210
What's going on exactly? Tell me!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.210
You're going to be my servant, aren't you?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.960
I'm really sorry, Edogawa-san!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.550
I need to go!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.220
I'll call you later!

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.970
Wait! Hold on, Sasami-san!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.940
Fine, be that way!

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:38.850
I don't care whether you come back!

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.320
Tama, hurry!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:42.980
I know!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.090
There she is!

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:09.720
Kagami?

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.850
Please... don't look.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.770
What's wrong?

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:20.980
What happened?

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:21.810
Kagami?

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.520
I feel strange.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.730
Kagami...?

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.940
I should be happy.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.780
I should be rooting for you.

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:33.490
But when I see you trying to get close to Edogawa-san, I just...

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.580
I don't know why.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:40.290
A person dear to me is about to make a new friend,

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.880
about to realize her wish and become happy.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.710
But I can't bring myself to cheer you on!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.130
I must be broken!

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:57.140
I'm a robot, so I should be kept away
from humans when I'm malfunctioning!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.390
Kagami...

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:03.560
You're not a robot.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.150
You don't have to cheer me on.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:07.150
Just...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.400
stay by my side.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.540
You're human.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.790
You're as human as any other girl.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.670
That's why you were hurt.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.220
I hurt you.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.470
So I'm the one who should be apologizing.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.970
Don't cry, Kagami.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.060
I'm sorry.

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:51.070
You should be paying attention to Edogawa-san, not me.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.700
You're an idiot. Utterly foolish.

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.030
Believe me.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.280
No matter how I change,

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.620
or who I get involved with,

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.290
or what happens to the world,

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:01.200
I will

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.040
always love you, Kagami.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.830
Not having you by my side

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.330
is more painful than death.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.050
When I saw you making a new friend,

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:13.760
I couldn't help but think it was because I lack something humans have,

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:17.390
and that thought made me feel like running away.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.850
It made me feel like I should vanish.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:22.480
I'm strange.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:24.350
I must've broken.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.900
I'm glad you're getting that strange feeling.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:31.400
I feel truly blessed that you could be so hurt by my actions.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.070
What a terrible person...

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:36.320
you are.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.740
They all look happy.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.370
I wish things could stay like this forever.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.620
Don't you think so too, Juju-sama?

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.330
Huh? That's...

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.750
"Tsukuyomi Shrine Logbook."

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.170
"Kept by: Micchan."

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:53.050
"It was my birthday today."

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:59.800
"The head of the family, maybe as my birthday present, gave me a collar."

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:03.270
"It was as if he wanted me to put it on,"

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:06.520
"so I thought to myself, 'What's this guy thinking?'"

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:08.310
"But when I took a closer look,"

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.940
"it had his name on there."

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:16.490
"Then I noticed he was already buck naked and pretending to be a dog."

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:19.820
"An indescribable emotion swelled up inside me."

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.830
"My mind went blank again,"

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.950
"and when I came to my senses, he was..."

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.460
I'm so sorry!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:28.830
Where is that man?!

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.340
She's taking so long!

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:36.800
What's Sasami-san doing?!

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:39.340
She said she'd call me later!

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:42.680
You told her you didn't care whether she came back.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.440
Are you feeling lonely, Ojou-sama?

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:48.310
It...

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:50.900
It's not that I'm feeling lonely!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.820
I'm just waiting for our duel!

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:55.570
Whatever you say.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.200
It's so good!

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.200
What are you doing, Tama?!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.200
What happened to you being Sasami-san?

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:10.170
Mamarin used too much spiritual power, so she's taking a break.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.590
Kagami-nee, I want that too!

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:15.880
I was only treating you because you were Sasami-san!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.130
Come on, I want it!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.430
Onee-sama!

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:23.010
Stop acting like an infant!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:24.890
Why...

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.270
Fireworks.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.030
What a beautiful view.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:45.950
Yeah.

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:54.790
It sure is beautiful...

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.300
Onii-chan.

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.430
Good night.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:15.360
All right, it's finally here! The miraculous showtime!

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:17.780
Using her gorgeous voice to sing for us tonight

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:20.030
is the ultra-famous world superstar,

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:21.820
Sasami-san!

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:24.740
Sasami! Sasami! Sasami!

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:26.830
Awesome! Start singing! Then strip!

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.000
Mamarin, go for it!

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:30.660
What? What's going on?

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:33.170
I told you, I'm not singing!

00:22:33.170 --> 00:22:35.290
That's not going to cut it!

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.420
The higher-ups are less than pleased about this,

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:39.210
so you really need to sing this time.

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.510
It won't kill you to sing it properly for once, will it?

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:46.470
Fine! I'll try, so you guys sing along with me, okay?

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:34.440
This is too much.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:36.730
I'm not going to try this hard again, got it?

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:40.150
Okay! You did a great job!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:46.240
It's time for Lazy Drama.

00:23:46.240 --> 00:23:47.700
Story so far.

00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:49.200
Things happened.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:51.620
Now, how will things turn out for them?

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:54.620
Things happened between us.

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.880
Yeah, a lot of things.

00:23:56.880 --> 00:23:58.130
To be continued.

00:23:58.130 --> 00:23:59.380
Next episode preview:

00:23:59.380 --> 00:24:01.000
Things happen.

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.880
A sudden development takes place.

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:04.630
How will things turn out for them?

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:06.130
Look forward to it!

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:10.180
Next time, final episode:
"I Won't Work Hard Tomorrow, Either."
